{"obsah":"<p>Excellent weather and turnout, a relaxed atmosphere and the desire to improve were the cornerstones of our camps. All participants tried not only to take in everything we wanted to pass on but also to overcome their fear. Of course, all with regard to the participants' bikes and their current abilities. The progress by the end of the camp was more than visible, and every single rider deserves praise. In the men's camp we made an exception and took on one mini guy with his dad, who was backed up by our team mascot Marty Kabeláč.</p>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2026%2F04%2FIMG_3893-1-scaled.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2026%2F04%2FIMG_3893-1.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-251211\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2026%2F04%2FIMG_3895-1-scaled.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2026%2F04%2FIMG_3895-1.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-251213\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2026%2F04%2FIMG_3915-scaled.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2026%2F04%2FIMG_3915.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-251217\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.